  "body": "   Estimated end-of-life date, accurate to within three months: 05-2027\r\n   See [the support level definitions](https://docs.datadoghq.com/tracing/trace_collection/compatibility/python/#releases) for more information.\r\n\r\n   ### Bug Fixes\r\n\r\n   - CI Visibility: Fixes repeated Git history fetches that slow down successive `pytest` commands in the same shallow checkout. Fetches are retried when the checked-out commit or shallow history changes.\r\n\r\n   - CI Visibility: skip the `git fetch --shallow-since` unshallow on shallow clones when the backend already knows all local commits and the pull request merge-base is not needed or user-supplied (`DD_GIT_PULL_REQUEST_BASE_BRANCH_SHA`); shallow-graph merge-bases are untrusted and recomputed."
